    "languageDirective": "This course will be taught in Chinese (Simplified), as the user's requirement text is written in Chinese. All terminology for sine (正弦), cosine (余弦), tangent (正切), unit circle (单位圆), and right triangle (直角三角形) will use standard Chinese mathematical terms. The teaching language will be Chinese throughout, with simple and clear explanations suitable for beginners.",
